1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,269
Writing, task two. E-mail number 8: Children's party.

2
00:00:05,967 --> 00:00:17,354
You want to hold your son's birthday party. Write an e-mail to a children's centre. Write at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

3
00:00:26,067 --> 00:00:27,133
Good afternoon,

4
00:00:27,433 --> 00:00:29,790
I would like to hold a birthday party at your place.

5
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:31,805
My son will be ten years old.

6
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:35,208
We'd like the party on Saturday 14 March in the afternoon.

7
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:36,890
Twelve children will come.

8
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:40,236
We'd like a programme with games and face painting.

9
00:00:40,533 --> 00:00:43,487
For food we'd like pizza, lemonade and a cake.

10
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:45,113
How much will it cost?

11
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:52,620
This e-mail has 48 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

12
00:00:53,333 --> 00:01:02,344
Write your own e-mail on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
